{
  "_about": [
    "Word-to-axis dictionary for questionnaire item 2 ('describe yourself in 3-5 words').",
    "matcher.html loads this at runtime. Edit freely: keys are lowercase words or",
    "multi-word phrases (tokens are comma-separated on the form, so 'problem solver'",
    "is one token). Each word maps to one or two of the five axes:",
    "hands_on, structure, ideation, people, analysis.",
    "Words that are NOT in here (stubborn, night owl, funny, ambitious, introvert, ...)",
    "are shown struck-through on the group cards as 'ignored by the algorithm'.",
    "That gap is a teaching moment, on purpose. Do not try to cover everything."
  ],
  "axes": {
    "hands_on": "makes things, learns by doing",
    "structure": "plans, organizes, keeps order",
    "ideation": "generates ideas, imagines, expresses",
    "people": "listens, connects, holds the group",
    "analysis": "questions, dissects, reasons"
